      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1788293282908,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1) Requests/sec\n2) Tokens/sec\n3) Time to First Token — TTFT\n4) Inter-token latency\n5) p50 / p95 / p99 latency\n6) Queue depth\n7) Queue waiting time\n8) Batch size\n9) Batch efficiency\n10) KV-cache utilization\n11) KV-cache hit ratio\n12) GPU memory pressure\n13) Model load time\n14) OOM rate\n15) Error rate\n16) Rate-limit events\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1) Requests/sec\n2) Tokens/sec\n3) Time to First Token — TTFT\n4) Inter-token latency\n5) p50 / p95 / p99 latency\n6) Queue depth\n7) Queue waiting time\n8) Batch size\n9) Batch efficiency\n10) KV-cache utilization\n11) KV-cache hit ratio\n12) GPU memory pressure\n13) Model load time\n14) OOM rate\n15) Error rate\n16) Rate-limit events\n",
      "autoResize": true,
