      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1788297138633,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "3) How would you detect staggler GPU?",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "3) How would you detect staggler GPU?",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "LhjEhAfGViC2l0kDC7uRV",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 307.0141741454119,
      "y": 3202.1712572886327,
      "width": 724.8194580078125,
      "height": 400,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b1L",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 66574872,
      "version": 162,
      "versionNonce": 1841610344,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1788297443234,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "- Distributed training often has synchronization points such as all-reduce.\n- Ex: even though GPUs 0, 1, 3 finish early, we still wait for GPU2\n- Metrics I’d compare per GPU/rank:\nstep latency\nforward latency\nbackward latency\nall-reduce latency\nGPU utilization\nSM utilization\nHBM utilization/bandwidth\ntemperature\npower\nclock frequency\nPCIe throughput\nNVLink throughput/errors\nECC/XID errors",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- Distributed training often has synchronization points such as all-reduce.\n- Ex: even though GPUs 0, 1, 3 finish early, we still wait for GPU2\n- Metrics I’d compare per GPU/rank:\nstep latency\nforward latency\nbackward latency\nall-reduce latency\nGPU utilization\nSM utilization\nHBM utilization/bandwidth\ntemperature\npower\nclock frequency\nPCIe throughput\nNVLink throughput/errors\nECC/XID errors",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "FB50--TFg3cqBGcc1TlKA",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 314.7259438306817,
      "y": 3636.9733160785245,
      "width": 648.3395385742188,
      "height": 25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b1M",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1976701720,
      "version": 5,
      "versionNonce": 1082378008,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1788297458642,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "straggler_score = GPU_step_time / median_step_time_of_cluster",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "straggler_score = GPU_step_time / median_step_time_of_cluster",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
