      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "4) How would NVLink problems affect distributed training?",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "4) How would NVLink problems affect distributed training?",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "3GXs2W9AFZ9e5yV2jKoMc",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 308.09580187934245,
      "y": 3766.261084129632,
      "width": 603.3595581054688,
      "height": 25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b1P",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 276238440,
      "version": 6,
      "versionNonce": 1123536744,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1788297775435,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "- NVLink provides high-bandwidth GPU-to-GPU communication.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- NVLink provides high-bandwidth GPU-to-GPU communication.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "hg7qZ-tG6Uq7C8nIS2QbX",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 311.4108728550121,
      "y": 3842.5077165700322,
      "width": 407.8798828125,
      "height": 175,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b1Q",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 978383384,
      "version": 108,
      "versionNonce": 1035716632,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1788297896748,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "GPU0 ←──── NVLink ────→ GPU1\n ↑                                           ↑\n │                                          │\nNVLink                                   NVLink\n │                                          │\n ↓                                           ↓\nGPU2 ←──── NVLink ────→ GPU3",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "GPU0 ←──── NVLink ────→ GPU1\n ↑                                           ↑\n │                                          │\nNVLink                                   NVLink\n │                                          │\n ↓                                           ↓\nGPU2 ←──── NVLink ────→ GPU3",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "PBUvC4D4GLXPAPYO2yW3J",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 311.41087285501203,
      "y": 4044.727046085881,
      "width": 869.417766270871,
      "height": 275,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b1S",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1643448856,
      "version": 206,
      "versionNonce": 689540200,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1788297964103,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "- In distributed training, communication performance is part of GPU performance. A\nperfectly healthy GPU can become a cluster straggler because the link connecting it is\nunhealthy.\n- Metrics I care about:\nNVLink health\nNVSwitch health\nPCIe\ntopology\nNCCL logs\nXID errors\nnetwork fabric telemetry",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- In distributed training, communication performance is part of GPU performance. A perfectly healthy GPU can become a cluster straggler because the link connecting it is unhealthy.\n- Metrics I care about:\nNVLink health\nNVSwitch health\nPCIe\ntopology\nNCCL logs\nXID errors\nnetwork fabric telemetry",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "3nGC-hGltIJ7gd417kDtc",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 314.7259438306816,
      "y": 4343.083433896148,
      "width": 512.2996826171875,
      "height": 50,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#e03131",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b1T",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 436600600,
      "version": 60,
      "versionNonce": 792493928,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1788298119690,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "5) What metrics matter the most for LLM inference?\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "5) What metrics matter the most for LLM inference?\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "46vqh-AvNIP9ZAGCFzfMx",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 314.4650045750975,
      "y": 4385.075553638906,
      "width": 764.4196166992188,
      "height": 1150,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b1U",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 97835112,
      "version": 360,
      "versionNonce": 2095511064,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1788301312892,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1) User latency\n-- TTFT: Time to first token ==>  how quickly the user starts seeing output\n-- TPOT: Time per output token ==> generation speed after the first token.\n\nrequest\n |\n |------ 350 ms ------> first token\n                          |\n                          |--40ms-- token\n                                  |--40ms-- token\n\nTTFT = 350 ms\nTPOT ≈ 40 ms\n\n\n2) Throughput\n-- requests/sec\n-- input tokens/sec\n-- output tokens/sec\n-- total tokens/sec\n\n3) GPU efficiency\n-- GPU utilization\n-- SM utilization\n-- Tensor Core utilization\n-- HBM bandwidth\n-- power\n-- clock\n\n4) Memory\n-- HBM used\n-- HBM utilization\n-- KV-cache utilization\n-- KV-cache hit/reuse rate\n-- KV-cache eviction\n-- OOM count\n-- memory fragmentation\n\n5) Queueing\n-- HBM used\n-- HBM utilization\n-- KV-cache utilization\n-- KV-cache hit/reuse rate\n-- KV-cache eviction\n-- OOM count\n-- memory fragmentation",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1) User latency\n-- TTFT: Time to first token ==>  how quickly the user starts seeing output\n-- TPOT: Time per output token ==> generation speed after the first token.\n\nrequest\n |\n |------ 350 ms ------> first token\n                          |\n                          |--40ms-- token\n                                  |--40ms-- token\n\nTTFT = 350 ms\nTPOT ≈ 40 ms\n\n\n2) Throughput\n-- requests/sec\n-- input tokens/sec\n-- output tokens/sec\n-- total tokens/sec\n\n3) GPU efficiency\n-- GPU utilization\n-- SM utilization\n-- Tensor Core utilization\n-- HBM bandwidth\n-- power\n-- clock\n\n4) Memory\n-- HBM used\n-- HBM utilization\n-- KV-cache utilization\n-- KV-cache hit/reuse rate\n-- KV-cache eviction\n-- OOM count\n-- memory fragmentation\n\n5) Queueing\n-- HBM used\n-- HBM utilization\n-- KV-cache utilization\n-- KV-cache hit/reuse rate\n-- KV-cache eviction\n-- OOM count\n-- memory fragmentation",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "KG7FZAdtxlgoY6312Dn5I",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 751.851215093868,
      "y": 4755.169937712766,
      "width": 576.9884899539596,
      "height": 625,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b1V",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 508700440,
      "version": 459,
      "versionNonce": 296592295,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1788364035624,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "** KV Cache is one of the primary capacity constraint\n** KV Cache is a memory optimization technique used\nduring large language model (LLM) inference to store\nintermediate key and value vectors from previous tokens,\navoiding redundant calculations and speeding up text\ngeneration.\n\n\n\nScheduler/batching\n-- batch size\n-- continuous batch size\n-- batch occupancy\n-- requests waiting\n-- tokens waiting\n-- prefill batch size\n-- decode batch size\n\nreliability\n-- error rate\n-- timeout rate\n-- OOM\n-- model load failures\n-- GPU/XID errors\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "** KV Cache is one of the primary capacity constraint\n** KV Cache is a memory optimization technique used during large language model (LLM) inference to store intermediate key and value vectors from previous tokens, avoiding redundant calculations and speeding up text generation.\n\n\n\nScheduler/batching\n-- batch size\n-- continuous batch size\n-- batch occupancy\n-- requests waiting\n-- tokens waiting\n-- prefill batch size\n-- decode batch size\n\nreliability\n-- error rate\n-- timeout rate\n-- OOM\n-- model load failures\n-- GPU/XID errors\n",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "Wmz3_chWcAfexjc6Kv_qq",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -333.37841728129797,
      "y": 1178.4168047834078,
      "width": 321.39461790800755,
      "height": 373.28182036390024,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#2f9e44",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
