      "originalText": "Low SM utilization + high CPU/data-loader time\n→ input pipeline bottleneck\n\nHigh SM utilization + slower compute\n→ GPU throttling / different GPU performance / workload imbalance\n\nLow NVLink throughput or retransmission/errors\n→ interconnect issue\n\nHigh H2D time\n→ PCIe / pinned-memory / NUMA issue\n\nOne rank gets larger batches / longer sequences\n→ workload imbalance\n\nECC errors, clock reduction, temperature/power cap\n→ hardware degradation\n\nAll GPUs show high collective time\n→ find which rank arrives at the collective last",
